# lu1020 r2 (2026-10-20): the Gemma 4 E2B protocol rows on the Mac Studio (M4 Max) on the current Mac pin
# (LiteRT-LM v0.18.0: environment.lock.json arms.litert-lm.mac; the .build/dd-mac yardstick of 2026-10-19,
# whose libCLiteRTLM_mac.dylib is the v0.18.0 release artifact's, sha256 9526db9e...), GPU and CPU, for the
# comparison with the Hugging Face card of litert-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-litert-lm (rev 41c55696: prefill 1024,
# decode 256, context 2048, CPU = XNNPACK with 4 threads, "caches enabled and initialized").
# The rows are the weekly protocol row (matrices/dashboard-protocol1024-v1.cells) and its backend=cpu twin; the
# yardstick passes no thread count, so the CPU arm runs the engine default (CpuConfig number_of_threads = 4).
# One launch per row, runs = the runner's default 4: run 1 = the first benchmark() call in the process (cold),
# runs 2-4 warm (same process; each call builds a new engine; the on-disk caches in $TMPDIR are read).
# GPU first, then CPU (a CPU run writes an XNNPACK weight cache; agreed-protocol-gemma4.md "Traps"). Before the CPU row,
# one cache launch (native-benchmark-128x16, runs=1, its own cell that no page or table reads): it builds the XNNPACK
# weight cache in $TMPDIR when there is none, so every run of the CPU protocol row reads it ("caches enabled and
# initialized"); the round removes the cache it created after the sitting. The GPU program and weight caches of this
# file are already in $TMPDIR (written 2026-10-19 07:11 and read by the v0.18.0 sittings since).
# The file starts with the platform's session anchor row (matrices/anchors.cells line 21, byte-identical): the job
# re-judges the payload session by the anchor records inside its own campaign (docs/dashboard-recurring-job-v1.md §4).
mac mlx-swift mlx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-4bit short-chat anchor=1 runs=3
mac litert-lm litert-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-litert-lm native-benchmark-1024x256 cooldown=300 context-tokens=2048
mac litert-lm litert-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-litert-lm native-benchmark-128x16 backend=cpu runs=1 cooldown=30 context-tokens=2048
mac litert-lm litert-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-litert-lm native-benchmark-1024x256 backend=cpu cooldown=300 context-tokens=2048
